<title>USA: Katz Digital names Donald Flamm CFO.</title>
<headline>Katz Digital names Donald Flamm CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Katz Digital Technologies Inc said on Tuesday it named Donald Flamm, 53, vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Flamm was senior vice president of finance and administration for Comtex Information Systems Inc, a New York-based computer services firm.</p>
<p>The CFO position had been vacant, the company said.</p>
<p>Katz provides digital printing and digital prepress services.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
